name: count_twos
ret: int
kind: loop
sig: fn count_twos(n: int) -> [] int
desc: How many times 2 divides n evenly (the exponent of 2 in n). count_twos(12) is 2. Domain: 1 <= n <= 1000000.
example: count_twos(8) == 3
example: count_twos(12) == 2
example: count_twos(7) == 0
